{"version":2,"surah":97,"verses":[{"n":1,"key":"97:1","arabic":"إِنَّآ أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ فِى لَيْلَةِ ٱلْقَدْرِ","page":598,"juz":30,"en":"Indeed, We sent it [i.e., the Qur’ān] down during the Night of Decree.","id":"Sesungguhnya Kami telah menurunkannya (Alquran) pada malam qadar.","latinEn":"Inna anzalnahu fee laylatialqadr","latinId":"Innā anzalnāhu fī lailatil-qadr(i).","words":[{"a":"إِنَّآ","en":"Indeed, We","id":"Indeed, We","t":"innā"},{"a":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","en":"revealed it","id":"revealed it","t":"anzalnāhu"},{"a":"فِى","en":"in","id":"in","t":"fī"},{"a":"لَيْلَةِ","en":"(the) Night","id":"(the) Night","t":"laylati"},{"a":"ٱلْقَدْرِ","en":"(of) Power","id":"(of) Power","t":"l-qadri"}]},{"n":2,"key":"97:2","arabic":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ","page":598,"juz":30,"en":"And what can make you know what is the Night of Decree?","id":"Dan tahukah kamu apakah malam kemuliaan itu?","latinEn":"Wama adraka ma laylatualqadr","latinId":"Wa mā adrāka mā lailatul-qadr(i).","words":[{"a":"وَمَآ","en":"And what","id":"And what","t":"wamā"},{"a":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","en":"can make you know","id":"can make you know","t":"adrāka"},{"a":"مَا","en":"what","id":"what","t":"mā"},{"a":"لَيْلَةُ","en":"(the) Night","id":"(the) Night","t":"laylatu"},{"a":"ٱلْقَدْرِ","en":"(of) Power (is)","id":"(of) Power (is)","t":"l-qadri"}]},{"n":3,"key":"97:3","arabic":"لَيْلَةُ ٱلْقَدْرِ خَيْرٌ مِّنْ أَلْفِ شَهْرٍ","page":598,"juz":30,"en":"The Night of Decree is better than a thousand months.","id":"Malam kemuliaan itu lebih baik daripada seribu bulan.","latinEn":"Laylatu alqadri khayrun min alfi shahr","latinId":"Lailatul-qadri khairum min alfi syahr(in).","words":[{"a":"لَيْلَةُ","en":"(The) Night","id":"(The) Night","t":"laylatu"},{"a":"ٱلْقَدْرِ","en":"(of) Power","id":"(of) Power","t":"l-qadri"},{"a":"خَيْرٌۭ","en":"(is) better","id":"(is) better","t":"khayrun"},{"a":"مِّنْ","en":"than","id":"than","t":"min"},{"a":"أَلْفِ","en":"a thousand","id":"a thousand","t":"alfi"},{"a":"شَهْرٍۢ","en":"month(s)","id":"month(s)","t":"shahrin"}]},{"n":4,"key":"97:4","arabic":"تَنَزَّلُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ وَٱلرُّوحُ فِيهَا بِإِذْنِ رَبِّهِم مِّن كُلِّ أَمْرٍ","page":598,"juz":30,"en":"The angels and the Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] descend therein by permission of their Lord for every matter.","id":"Pada malam itu turun para malaikat dan Ruh (Jibril) dengan izin Tuhannya untuk mengatur semua urusan.","latinEn":"Tanazzalu almala-ikatu warroohufeeha bi-ithni rabbihim min kulli amr","latinId":"Tanazzalul-malā'ikatu war rūḥu fīhā bi'iżni rabbihim min kulli amr(in).","words":[{"a":"تَنَزَّلُ","en":"Descend","id":"Descend","t":"tanazzalu"},{"a":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","en":"the Angels","id":"the Angels","t":"l-malāikatu"},{"a":"وَٱلرُّوحُ","en":"and the Spirit","id":"and the Spirit","t":"wal-rūḥu"},{"a":"فِيهَا","en":"therein","id":"therein","t":"fīhā"},{"a":"بِإِذْنِ","en":"by (the) permission","id":"by (the) permission","t":"bi-idh'ni"},{"a":"رَبِّهِم","en":"(of) their Lord","id":"(of) their Lord","t":"rabbihim"},{"a":"مِّن","en":"for","id":"for","t":"min"},{"a":"كُلِّ","en":"every","id":"every","t":"kulli"},{"a":"أَمْرٍۢ","en":"affair","id":"affair","t":"amrin"}]},{"n":5,"key":"97:5","arabic":"سَلَـٰمٌ هِىَ حَتَّىٰ مَطْلَعِ ٱلْفَجْرِ","page":598,"juz":30,"en":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn.","id":"Sejahteralah (malam itu) sampai terbit fajar.","latinEn":"Salamun hiya hatta matlaAAialfajr","latinId":"Salāmun hiya ḥattā maṭla‘il-fajr(i).","words":[{"a":"سَلَـٰمٌ","en":"Peace","id":"Peace","t":"salāmun"},{"a":"هِىَ","en":"it (is)","id":"it (is)","t":"hiya"},{"a":"حَتَّىٰ","en":"until","id":"until","t":"ḥattā"},{"a":"مَطْلَعِ","en":"(the) emergence","id":"(the) emergence","t":"maṭlaʿi"},{"a":"ٱلْفَجْرِ","en":"(of) the dawn","id":"(of) the dawn","t":"l-fajri"}]}]}